          'Selling babywear direct is not the same as shipping it to an importer. Parents ask more questions than almost any other online shopper, and forgive less. A baby products marketing agency in Coimbatore has to help a factory explain its care and quality in plain language, reach both parents and gift buyers, and stay in touch as the child grows into the next size.',
